V3.0 Introduces a 'quick' index routine for use with CD's or other devices not in
the FileCat. Please note the use of new keywords QDIR, USEQUICKINDEX & 
STRINGNODESC. These are all explained in the doc, please read and understand
them before trying to use the 'quick' index. DO NOT confuse the QUICKINDEX with
FASTINDEX. On local tests, with a my vanilla A3000/25, any file on the online
CD ( 5322 files ) was found within  one second, unfortunately time is taken up 
by the nodelist routines and various other checks, I'll try and speed them up 
somewhat.

Ciao,

Martin
